## [0.2.15] - 2026-05-08

### Fixed

- **Corporation shareholder votes now resolve from the turn processor** - Open governance, relocation, dissolution, share-issuance, and privatization votes are swept every corporation turn. Generic shareholder votes now finalize once the outcome is mathematically certain or the deadline has passed, instead of waiting for a player to open the vote detail endpoint. Privatization votes continue to settle at deadline through their dedicated buyout resolver. `src/lib/turn/corporation/voteReminders.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/index.ts`.
- **Corporation vote side effects are protected from parallel readers** - `resolveCorporationVoteIfReady` now atomically claims the open-to-terminal status transition and returns `claimed`, so only the winning resolver applies passed-vote effects or sends pass/fail notifications. Release audit also changed the corporation turn to await the auto-resolve sweep and applies passed-vote effects before notifications so a notification failure cannot block share issuance, governance, or relocation effects. `src/lib/corporations/votes/voteService.ts`, `src/app/api/corporations/[id]/votes/[voteId]/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/voteReminders.ts`.
- **Stranded share-issuance vote repair migration** - Added a one-shot dry-run-by-default migration for share-issuance votes that were marked `passed` before the old in-memory status guard allowed their effects to apply. It deduplicates repeated identical CEO proposals per corporation and applies the most recent intended issuance only. `scripts/migrations/2026-05-08-backfill-stranded-share-issuance-votes.ts`.
- **Filed slate invitations can now be withdrawn cleanly** - Party leadership can withdraw a slate row even after the candidate filed; the route now marks the live `electionCandidates` row withdrawn, removes the candidate from the tally, deletes the campaign doc, and then removes the slate invitation. The UI warns that a filed candidate will be pulled off the ballot. `src/app/api/country/[code]/parties/[id]/slate/[electionId]/invitations/[candidateRowId]/route.ts`, `src/app/country/[code]/parties/[id]/components/SlateTab.tsx`.

### Documentation

- **Release docs refreshed for v0.2.15** - Version metadata, README release surfaces, public/dev changelogs, and corporation wiki/design docs now reflect the latest corporation vote behavior, recent Germany status, Railway/Vercel deployment wording, and the `development -> staging -> master` promotion flow.

