- **Treasurer Phase 2 presets and insights** - National and state Treasury surfaces now support Treasurer presets that auto-fill reserve targets and budget ratios, while the national Treasury page adds leadership-only state funding visibility and both scopes add emergency override history cards. New `/treasury/insights` routes aggregate recent transfer recipients, low-cash state parties, expansion opportunities, growth leaders, and reserve-piercing override logs so party leadership can see both where money is going and where it should go. `src/lib/treasury/partyTreasuryPresets.ts`, `src/lib/treasury/partyTreasuryInsights.ts`, `src/components/party/TreasuryFundingInsightsCard.tsx`, `src/components/party/TreasuryOverrideHistoryCard.tsx`, `src/app/country/[code]/parties/[id]/components/TreasuryPanel.tsx`, `src/app/country/[code]/region/[id]/party/[partyId]/components/StatePartyFundraisingPanel.tsx`, `src/app/api/country/[code]/parties/[id]/treasury/insights/route.ts`, `src/app/api/country/[code]/region/[id]/party/[partyId]/treasury/insights/route.ts`

- **Relationship-gated caucus NPP recruitment** - The Caucus `Chair's Office` now includes a `Recruit NPP to Caucus` control that shows same-party NPPs, the Chair's current relationship with each one, and whether they are eligible to join. Caucus NPP recruitment now requires at least 60 relationship with the target NPP, hides NPPs already attached to any caucus from the recruit menu, and applies a 12-hour caucus-wide cooldown after any successful NPP recruitment. Relationships with NPPs now decay by 0.1 toward neutral each turn, and caucus NPPs automatically leave when their relationship with the current Chair falls below 20 after upkeep. `src/app/country/[code]/parties/[id]/components/CaucusesTab.tsx`, `src/app/api/country/[code]/parties/[id]/caucuses/[slug]/members/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/partyOrg.ts`, `src/lib/turn/partyOrg/caucusRelationshipMaintenance.ts`

