## [0.0.37] - 2026-02-21

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **Commodity world map visualization** — Interactive world map on commodity detail pages showing supply or demand intensity per country with color-coded shading. Click a country to see a stat card with supply/demand breakdown; drill into country-level regional maps (US states, UK regions) for granular detail. New component suite: `CommodityWorldMapView`, `CommodityCountryStatCard`, `CommodityCountryDrilldownView`, `CommodityRegionMap`, `CommodityMapModeToggle`, `CommodityMapLegend`. New utility layer `src/lib/commodity-map/` handles aggregation, color scales, country→SVG registry, and region mappings.
- **Commodity hero images** — Commodity detail pages now display a hero banner image sourced from Wikimedia Commons, giving each commodity a visual identity. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/app/commodity/[type]/page.tsx`.
- **Commodity combined charts** — Price history and supply/demand charts merged into a single card with a toggle button, reducing visual clutter on the commodity detail page. `src/app/commodity/[type]/page.tsx`.
- **Commodity hero stats strip** — Key commodity stats (price, supply, demand, balance) moved into a compact hero strip above the charts. Stock market page tab selection now persists across navigation. `src/app/commodity/[type]/page.tsx`, `src/app/stockmarket/[country]/page.tsx`.
- **Defaulted bond buyback** — CEOs can now buy back defaulted bond units from the public float at face value ($1,000/unit), allowing gradual debt reduction without the discount exploit. Bonds auto-mature when all units (public float + holders) are retired. New "Retire Debt" panel on bond detail page for CEOs with outstanding public float. `src/app/api/bonds/[bondId]/buyback/route.ts`, `src/app/bond/[id]/page.tsx`.
- **Distressed debt trading** — Players can now buy defaulted bonds on the open market (distressed debt trading). CEOs are blocked from buying their own corporation's defaulted bonds to prevent self-dealing. `src/app/api/bonds/[bondId]/buy/route.ts`.
- **Regional breakdown improvements** — Commodity regional breakdown table is now collapsible, grouped by country, uses friendly region names, and sorts by supply/demand volume. `src/app/commodity/[type]/page.tsx`.

### Changed

- **Global Monetary Policy chart currency colors** — Chart now imports `CURRENCY_COLORS` from `currencyDisplay.ts` instead of defining a local subset, so EUR, CNY, BRL, and all other currencies render with the same theme-aware color palette used across the forex page. `src/components/forex/GlobalMonetaryPolicyChart.tsx`, `src/components/forex/currencyDisplay.ts`
- **Central bank hero images for ECB, PBoC, and BCB** — Added hero images (Wikipedia Commons photos) for the European Central Bank (Frankfurt building), People's Bank of China, and Banco Central do Brasil. Ireland's ECB config also updated. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/countries.ts`

- **COMMODITY_LOG_K reduced from 65 to 40** — Commodity margin modifier sensitivity lowered to reduce extreme margin swings from supply/demand imbalances. At K=40, a moderate shortage (1.4× ratio, rate=0.25) hits ~-3.4% instead of ~-5.5%. `src/lib/constants/commodities.ts`.
- **Mobile profile layout condensed** — On small screens, character name, party badge, member-since date, and edit-profile button now sit beside the avatar instead of stacking below it. Text sizes reduced on mobile. Applies to both self-profile (`ProfileHeader`) and public character pages. Desktop/tablet layout unchanged. `src/app/profile/components/ProfileHeader.tsx`, `src/app/character/[id]/page.tsx`.
- **Stock market tab persistence** — Selected tab (Stocks, Bonds, Commodities) on the stock exchange page now persists in the URL via query parameter, so browser back/forward and sharing work correctly. `src/app/stockmarket/[country]/page.tsx`.

### Fixed

- **Bond holdings missing from corp tangible book value** — When a corporation buys bonds (sovereign or corporate), the purchased bond asset was not included in the tangible book component of the share-price formula. Only `issuedBondDebt` (bonds issued by the corp) was in the formula; held bond positions were tracked in `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` but never wired in. Added `bondHoldingsAnchor` field to `SharePriceInput` and included it in the `tangibleBook` calculation: `liquidCapital + sectorNPV + bondHoldings − issuedDebt`. Wired from `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` in both `sectorCalculations.ts` and `recomputeSharePrices.ts`. `src/lib/turn/corporation/sharePriceFormula.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/sectorCalculations.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/recomputeSharePrices.ts`
- **Wealth bonus misdirected** — Character creation wealth bonus was incorrectly added to campaign funds instead of personal cash (`cashOnHand`). Now the wealth bonus goes to personal cash and base campaign funds come solely from `gameConfig`. `src/app/api/auth/character/route.ts`.
- **Globe animation performance** — `RotatingGlobe` animation throttled from ~60fps to ~20fps React re-renders. Continuous `setRotation` calls caused expensive SVG re-projection on every frame, blocking the main thread and making lander buttons unresponsive. `src/components/RotatingGlobe.tsx`.
- **Commodity hero image URLs** — Fixed broken commodity hero images by using verified Wikimedia Commons direct URLs. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`.

