## [0.0.35] - 2026-02-20

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **National budget system** — Full US and UK treasury panels with dynamic fiscal costs, revenue breakdowns, and spending categories. UK treasury includes healthcare, education, defence, welfare, and transport line items. US treasury mirrors with federal equivalents. Budget tables display enacted policy costs and revenue sources. `src/app/api/budget/`, budget page components.
- **UK public healthcare corporation model** — Added NHS-style public healthcare corporation for the UK. Healthcare sectors sized and seeded appropriately. National corporations now display alongside private corporations on budget and sector pages. `feat(budget): add UK public healthcare corporation model`.
- **Sovereign bond issuance** — Sovereign bonds can now be issued by governments with debt-driven demand mechanics. Added admin test issuance route for sovereign debt instruments. `src/app/api/bonds/`, `src/app/api/admin/sovereign-debt/`.
- **Admin setup dashboard** — New `/admin/setup` page with status dashboard and one-click setup. Idempotent `/api/admin/setup` route bootstraps the entire database (seeds, budgets, demographics, party orgs) in a single call. `src/app/admin/setup/page.tsx`, `src/app/api/admin/setup/route.ts`.
- **Auto-seed on startup** — Server automatically seeds the database on startup if collections are empty. `seed:all` npm script added to run all seed commands in sequence. `src/lib/seed/`.
- **Commodity flow detail** — Sector detail page now shows per-commodity weight percentage and margin impact in a "Commodity Flows" breakdown. `src/app/corporation/[id]/sector/[sectorId]/page.tsx`.
- **UK Commons party org support** — Party organization system extended to support UK House of Commons. Stale party ID healing added to fix party org records with outdated identifiers. `src/lib/turn/partyOrg/`.
- **Admin party elections panel** — Enhanced party elections admin panel with country support, restart action, combined heal and batch actions. Country column added to heal leadership elections view. `src/components/admin/`.
- **Admin NPP retire vacates seats** — Retiring NPPs via admin now also vacates their held seats. Separate "vacate only" button added. `src/app/api/admin/npps/`.
- **Discord bot corporation command** — Enriched Discord bot corporation command with bonds, shareholders, and financials tabs. `src/app/api/discord-bot/`.
- **AGENTS.md** — Added Cursor Cloud specific instructions for agent development environments. `AGENTS.md`.
- **Admin wiki sync from design docs** — `POST /api/admin/wiki/sync-design` upserts `wikiPages` from `docs/design` for `WIKI_PAGES` slugs (skips `elections` / `roadmap`; skips non-published rows unless `force: true`). `GET /api/admin/wiki/design-source/[slug]` serves markdown for the Override flow. Admin Wiki Pages: **Sync patch** per row and **Sync all from docs/design**. `src/lib/wiki/syncDesignDocs.ts`, `src/lib/wiki/designDocSources.ts`, `src/components/admin/WikiManagementTab.tsx`, `src/components/admin/wiki/WikiPageTable.tsx`.

### Changed

- **Global Monetary Policy chart currency colors** — Chart now imports `CURRENCY_COLORS` from `currencyDisplay.ts` instead of defining a local subset, so EUR, CNY, BRL, and all other currencies render with the same theme-aware color palette used across the forex page. `src/components/forex/GlobalMonetaryPolicyChart.tsx`, `src/components/forex/currencyDisplay.ts`
- **Central bank hero images for ECB, PBoC, and BCB** — Added hero images (Wikipedia Commons photos) for the European Central Bank (Frankfurt building), People's Bank of China, and Banco Central do Brasil. Ireland's ECB config also updated. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/countries.ts`

- **Corporate credit history & alerts** — Each corporation turn now writes `creditComposite` / `creditRating` on `corporationHistory`, updates `creditCompositeSnapshot` / `creditRatingSnapshot` on `corporations`, and when the **letter tier** changes logs `corp_credit_rating` wire events plus **`corp_credit_rating_change`** notifications to the CEO user. Shared helpers in `src/lib/bonds/corporateCredit.ts`; `GET /api/corporations/[id]/history` exposes credit fields; new **`GET /api/corporations/[id]/credit-peer-stats`** returns country and sector-type peer averages (composite + implied new-issue coupon). Credit tab adds composite **SVG history**, **what-if debt** slider (`calculateCreditScore` client-side), **peer context** panel, and documents wire + in-app alerts (no outbound email). Wire API/ticker support the new event type. `corporationTurn.ts`, `CreditRatingTab.tsx`, `notificationConfig.tsx`, `wire/route.ts`, `WireTicker.tsx`.

- **Corporation credit rating tab** — Richer layout: default-penalty callout, responsive hero, composite **0–100 gauge** with tier threshold ticks, **weighted subscore** cards (contribution to composite), **balance sheet context** (book equity, annual income, coupons, D/E, coverage) from new `creditDiagnostics` on `GET /api/corporations/[id]/bonds`, collapsible “how the engine uses these numbers”, **published scale** grid with score bands and spreads, **Bonds** deep link, and tooltips aligned to `calculateCreditScore`. `CreditRatingTab.tsx`, `CorporationPageTypes.ts`, `bonds/route.ts`.

- **Corporation sectors tab** — Replaced wide horizontal table with **per-sector cards**: metrics use **label-above-value** cells in a responsive grid (2→3→4→7 columns) to avoid sideways scroll on phones. **Sort** control: dropdown for location, type, growth %, growth cost, revenue, effective/base margin %, profit, workers, plus **Asc/Desc** toggle. `src/components/corporation/SectorsTab.tsx`.

- **Profile finances** — `FinancialOverview` is again a single **Finances** card with **Personal** / **Campaign** / **Corporate** tabs (Corporate only when you are CEO). Corporate liquid capital and sector rollups moved off the Personal table into the Corporate tab. `src/app/profile/components/FinancialOverview.tsx`, `src/app/profile/page.tsx`.

- **Policy alignment UI** — Merged political compass and detailed policy sliders into one `PolicyAlignmentCard` with **Compass** / **Axis detail** toggle on profile, public character, politician wiki, and party wiki pages. Compass view now labels economic (horizontal) and social (vertical, liberal −5 → traditional +5) and shows explicit numeric scores plus names. `PoliticalCompass` supports `embedded` mode; `DetailedPolicyDisplay` adds `omitHeading` and `inset`.
- **Universal policy axis labels** — `getEconomicAxisTickLabels`, `getSocialAxisTickLabels`, `POLICY_INTEGER_AXIS_RANGE`, and `getSocialPolicyColor` in `politics.ts` drive compass edges, slider footers, and `PolicyDisplay`/`DetailedPolicyDisplay` coloring (word-only ticks: Left/Center/Right, Liberal/Moderate/Traditional). Compass restyled (quadrant gradients, crosshair, corner labels `Left · Trad.` / `Right · Lib.`, subtler marker); score tiles and poll `LeanPip` show labels without raw numbers. NPP profile passes `axis` on `PolicyDisplay`.

- **Commodity price caps softened** — Price caps on commodities loosened to allow more natural market movement. Rolling annual change percentages added to commodity displays. Financial demand source explanation added to commodity detail pages. `src/lib/constants/commodities.ts`.
- **National metric history restored** — National metric history tracking restored after regression. Metrics now correctly record historical values each turn. `src/lib/turn/`.
- **Budget-derived national budgets** — National budgets now derive initial values from default policy settings rather than hardcoded values. `src/lib/seed/`.
- **Public enterprise revenue refresh** — Public enterprise (national corporation) revenue now refreshes per turn, keeping budget figures current. `src/lib/turn/`.
- **MongoDB driver capped at 6.x** — Capped mongodb driver at major version 6 for compatibility with older server wire protocols. `package.json`.
- **Self-hosted World Atlas** — TopoJSON world atlas files now self-hosted instead of fetched from external CDN. Parallel demographics fetch and UK region Suspense boundaries added. `src/components/`.

### Fixed

- **Bond holdings missing from corp tangible book value** — When a corporation buys bonds (sovereign or corporate), the purchased bond asset was not included in the tangible book component of the share-price formula. Only `issuedBondDebt` (bonds issued by the corp) was in the formula; held bond positions were tracked in `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` but never wired in. Added `bondHoldingsAnchor` field to `SharePriceInput` and included it in the `tangibleBook` calculation: `liquidCapital + sectorNPV + bondHoldings − issuedDebt`. Wired from `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` in both `sectorCalculations.ts` and `recomputeSharePrices.ts`. `src/lib/turn/corporation/sharePriceFormula.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/sectorCalculations.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/recomputeSharePrices.ts`
- **Poll in-race spoiler and archetypes** — Aligned in-race spoiler detection and archetype appeal calculations with the actual election engine, fixing polling results that diverged from real election outcomes. `src/app/api/elections/[id]/poll/route.ts`.
- **Admin gameConfig type error** — Fixed `findOne` type error when querying `gameConfig` collection with string `_id` values. `src/app/api/admin/setup/route.ts`.
- **Wiki build without DB** — Wiki segment now renders dynamically so Next.js build succeeds without a database connection. `src/app/wiki/`.
- **Seed upsert \_id errors** — Stripped `_id` from `$set` payloads in all seed upsert operations, preventing MongoDB immutable field errors on re-seed. Fixed corporation upsert to use `_id` filter to prevent duplicate key errors. `src/lib/seed/`.
- **National corporation display** — National corporations now have sequential IDs and URL fallbacks. Supported in sector and corporation pages. Market share capped at 100%, attack actions blocked on national corps. `src/app/corporation/`, `src/app/api/corporations/`.
- **State party canonical IDs** — Party org keys and membership now use canonical party ID, fixing state party org lookups that broke after the sequential ID migration. `src/lib/db/`.
- **Discord bot country filtering** — Party lookups in Discord bot sync-roles and prediction API now filter by `countryId`, preventing cross-country party collisions. Returns `partyColor` and avoids numeric party name fallbacks. `src/app/api/discord-bot/`.
- **Sentry error reporting** — Turn processor, API routes, UI error boundaries, and cron jobs now report errors to Sentry for observability. `src/lib/sentry/`.
- **Performance: batch queries** — Party influence org lookups and election enter queries now use batch operations. Admin demographics and state party org seeding uses `bulkWrite`. `src/lib/turn/`, `src/lib/seed/`.
- **Party org map filtering** — Party org map now only shows parties with valid `sequentialId`-based identifiers, hiding legacy/orphan records. `src/components/`.
- **Budget seed errors** — Fixed `_id` immutable field error on re-seed for budget documents. Healthcare sector sizing corrected. Enacted laws now seeded with budgets. Budgets included in UK universal seeder and default seed path. `src/lib/seed/`.
- **Election seatId resolution** — Election enter/withdraw and related routes now correctly resolve `seatId`, fixing errors when entering elections. `src/app/api/elections/`.
- **Stock market sequentialId fallback** — Stock market pages now fall back to ObjectId when a corporation lacks a `sequentialId`, preventing broken links. `src/app/stockmarket/`.
- **Party country scoping** — National party leadership elections and National Committee elections now include `countryId`. NPP influence states filtered by party country. Admin party membership healing scoped by country. `src/app/api/parties/`.
- **News page regressions** — Restored hero Post button, modal composer, wire ticker, and post ticker that were lost in a prior refactor. News compose now uses `#news-compose` hash anchor instead of a separate route. `src/app/news/`, `src/components/news/`.

### Refactored

- **News compose flow** — Dropped separate `/news?compose=true` query parameter route; news compose now uses `#news-compose` hash on the same `/news` URL for cleaner navigation. `src/app/news/page.tsx`.

