## [0.0.34] - 2026-02-18

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **Bond purchase UI** — Bond detail page now has a functional buy panel replacing the "coming soon" placeholder. Players can purchase bond units with a cost summary and max-units helper. CEOs see a "Purchase as" prompt to buy as themselves or their corporation. `src/app/bond/[id]/page.tsx`, `src/app/api/bonds/[bondId]/route.ts`.
- **Corporation bond holdings** — Corporation bonds tab now displays bonds the corporation holds in other companies, with issuer name, units, coupon rate, market value, and a total holdings value footer. `src/app/api/corporations/[id]/bonds/route.ts`, `src/app/corporation/[id]/page.tsx`.
- **Corporation dividend summary** — Corporation bonds tab now shows a dividend distribution card when the dividend rate is set, displaying rate, per-turn payout, annual payout, and per-share per-turn value. `src/app/corporation/[id]/page.tsx`.
- **News wire ticker** — News page now includes a scrolling wire event ticker with deceleration physics. `src/components/news/WireTicker.tsx`, `src/hooks/useTickerDecel.ts`, `src/lib/wireEvent.ts`.
- **Stock market page redesign** — NYSE/FTSE pages redesigned with hero image, LED-style scrolling stock ticker, table-based layouts for stocks/bonds/commodities/wealth list, and market overview panel. `src/app/stockmarket/[country]/page.tsx` and components.
- **Shareholder pie chart** — Corporation Shares tab now includes an SVG ownership distribution pie chart showing each shareholder's percentage and the public float. `src/components/corporation/SharesTab.tsx`.
- **State Economy nav link** — Navbar sidebar and state dropdown now include a direct link to the state Economy tab. `src/components/Navbar.tsx`, `src/components/StateDropdown.tsx`.
- **News post ticker** — News page displays a scrolling ticker of recent user posts in `@handle "content..."` format. `src/components/news/PostTicker.tsx`.
- **News composer modal** — News post creation moved from inline feed to a modal triggered by a "Post" button on the hero image. `src/app/news/page.tsx`, `src/components/news/NewsFeed.tsx`.
- **Wiki pages** — Added 3 new wiki pages: Corporations (shares, bonds, dividends, CEO management), Commodities (11 types, supply/demand, retail), and Relocation (cooldown, CEO rules, resets). Database seeded.

### Changed

- **Global Monetary Policy chart currency colors** — Chart now imports `CURRENCY_COLORS` from `currencyDisplay.ts` instead of defining a local subset, so EUR, CNY, BRL, and all other currencies render with the same theme-aware color palette used across the forex page. `src/components/forex/GlobalMonetaryPolicyChart.tsx`, `src/components/forex/currencyDisplay.ts`
- **Central bank hero images for ECB, PBoC, and BCB** — Added hero images (Wikipedia Commons photos) for the European Central Bank (Frankfurt building), People's Bank of China, and Banco Central do Brasil. Ireland's ECB config also updated. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/countries.ts`

- **Footer bar redesigned** — Right-side stats replaced with compact colored chips: red (actions), green (campaign funds), amber (personal cash). Numbers use K/M formatting. Icons hidden on mobile for density. Personal cash (`cashOnHand`) now displayed alongside campaign funds. `src/components/StatusBar.tsx`, `src/lib/characterStatsSync.ts`.

- **Corporation page tabs redesigned** — Replaced pill-button tabs with state-page-style underline tabs with icons. Tab selection is now URL-driven (`?tab=shares`), enabling shareable tab links and browser back/forward navigation. `src/app/corporation/[id]/page.tsx`, `src/components/corporation/CorporationPageConstants.tsx`.
- **CEO voting is now share-weighted** — CEO votes are weighted by the voter's total shares instead of 1-vote-per-shareholder. A shareholder with 500 shares contributes 500 votes to their candidate. Vote tallies display share counts instead of voter counts. `src/app/api/corporations/[id]/ceo/vote/route.ts`, `src/components/corporation/SharesTab.tsx`.
- **CEO self-voting allowed** — Shareholders can now vote for themselves as CEO candidate. Previously self-voting was blocked. `src/components/corporation/SharesTab.tsx`.
- **CEO candidates restricted to HQ state** — CEO vote candidates must reside in the corporation's headquarters state. The API returns 403 if a candidate is outside the HQ state. `src/app/api/corporations/[id]/ceo/vote/route.ts`.
- **Relocation cooldown enabled** — Character relocation now enforces a 48-hour (2-day) cooldown between moves. Previously disabled for testing (`COOLDOWN_DAYS = 0`). `src/app/api/character/relocate/route.ts`.
- **CEO auto-resign on relocation** — Relocating while serving as CEO automatically resigns the CEO position. The relocation response message and the RelocateButton confirmation modal warn CEOs before proceeding. `src/app/api/character/relocate/route.ts`, `src/components/RelocateButton.tsx`.
- **CEO must reside in HQ state** — Accepting a CEO position now requires the character to reside in the corporation's headquarters state. Returns 400 with a message naming the HQ state if not met. `src/app/api/corporations/[id]/ceo/accept/route.ts`.
- **Corporations start with 10 marketing strength** — New corporations are created with `marketingStrength: 10` instead of 0. `src/app/api/corporations/route.ts`.
- **Election cards redesigned** — Election listing and state election cards now use a consistent card design matching the election detail page style, with resolved party names and colors from DB. `src/components/elections/ElectionCard.tsx`, `src/components/StateElections.tsx`.
- **Sector commodity links** — Commodity icons and labels on the sector detail page are now clickable links to the commodity detail page. `src/app/corporation/[id]/sector/[sectorId]/page.tsx`.

### Fixed

- **Bond holdings missing from corp tangible book value** — When a corporation buys bonds (sovereign or corporate), the purchased bond asset was not included in the tangible book component of the share-price formula. Only `issuedBondDebt` (bonds issued by the corp) was in the formula; held bond positions were tracked in `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` but never wired in. Added `bondHoldingsAnchor` field to `SharePriceInput` and included it in the `tangibleBook` calculation: `liquidCapital + sectorNPV + bondHoldings − issuedDebt`. Wired from `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` in both `sectorCalculations.ts` and `recomputeSharePrices.ts`. `src/lib/turn/corporation/sharePriceFormula.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/sectorCalculations.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/recomputeSharePrices.ts`
- **Admin NPP party selection** — Fixed party selector in NPP admin panel conflating US and UK parties with the same sequentialId. Now uses composite keys (`countryId:sequentialId`) to distinguish parties across countries. `src/components/admin/NPPManagement.tsx`.
- **State NPP list party display** — Fixed NPPs on state Politics tab showing party logo but missing party name and color in PartyChip. Now fetches party info directly when loading NPPs. `src/app/state/[id]/page.tsx`, `src/components/state/politics/NPPsList.tsx`.
- **UK region Players/NPPs lists** — Added Players and NPPs lists to UK region Politics tab, matching the US state page layout. `src/app/country/[code]/region/[id]/page.tsx`, `src/components/uk/UKRegionPageTabsPolitics.tsx`.
- **National Committee voting** — Fixed "Invalid candidate ID" error when voting in National Committee elections. API was returning `sequentialId` as `characterId`, but the vote endpoint expected an ObjectId. Now returns both fields separately. `src/app/api/parties/[id]/committee/route.ts`.
- **MobileSelect modal positioning** — Fixed filter dropdown on Elections page appearing at bottom of screen on mobile devices with keyboard open. Centered modal and constrained max height. `src/components/ui/MobileSelect.tsx`.
- **Delete account modal on mobile** — Fixed delete account confirmation modal not appearing on mobile. Modal was hidden behind backdrop blur due to CSS stacking context. Now uses React Portal to render at document.body level. `src/app/settings/components/DangerZoneSection.tsx`.
- **UK region party display** — Fixed `getRegionPartyOrg()` missing `countryId` filter when querying parties, causing UK regions to match US parties with the same sequential IDs (e.g., showing "Democratic Party" instead of "Labour Party"). `src/app/country/[code]/region/[id]/page.tsx`.
- **Plaid Cymru missing from Wales** — Added missing `statePartyOrg` record for Plaid Cymru (sequentialId 5) in the `UK_WAL` region. DB fix.
- **Navbar party link for sequentialId parties** — Fixed `client-nav` route looking up parties by `_id` instead of `sequentialId`, causing the state party navbar link to not appear for players in parties using numeric IDs (all UK parties, newer US parties). `src/app/api/client-nav/route.ts`.
- **Admin national party appointment** — Fixed admin appoint route looking up parties by `slug` field instead of supporting `sequentialId` lookup. Also fixed member validation and election cancellation to use the correct party identifier. `src/app/api/admin/parties/[partyId]/appoint/route.ts`.
- **Election party name collisions** — Scoped party lookups by country to prevent cross-country name collisions in election displays. `src/app/elections/page.tsx`.
- **Discord bot party names** — Discord sync-roles now uses party names instead of raw sequentialId numbers. `src/app/api/discord-bot/sync-roles/route.ts`.

### Refactored

- **Corporation page split into components** — Extracted the 3900-line monolithic `page.tsx` into 10 focused files under `src/components/corporation/`: shared types, tab constants, helper components, and one file per tab (Financials, Sectors, Shares, Credit Rating, Bonds, Charts, CEO Office). Main page reduced to ~470 lines.

