## [0.0.33] - 2026-02-18

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **Game reset presets** — Admin reset panel now offers three starting condition presets: "2020 Start Date" (default parties + historical NPPs), "2020 Start Date - No NPPs" (default parties, no NPPs), and "2020 Start Date - No Parties" (no parties, no NPPs). Dropdown selector in reset modal. `src/app/api/admin/reset/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/historicalSeats.ts`.
- **Historical NPP seeding** — Game reset with default preset now seeds historical NPPs matching February 2020 composition. Includes governors, senators, and representatives from both parties. `src/lib/npp/seedHistorical.ts`.
- **Migration record deletion** — Admin Migrations tab now shows orphan migration records (records in DB but not in current migration definitions) with delete buttons. Added `DELETE /api/admin/migrations/status?id=` endpoint. Allows cleaning up failed or outdated migration records. `src/app/api/admin/migrations/status/route.ts`, `src/components/admin/MigrationsTab.tsx`.

### Changed

- **Global Monetary Policy chart currency colors** — Chart now imports `CURRENCY_COLORS` from `currencyDisplay.ts` instead of defining a local subset, so EUR, CNY, BRL, and all other currencies render with the same theme-aware color palette used across the forex page. `src/components/forex/GlobalMonetaryPolicyChart.tsx`, `src/components/forex/currencyDisplay.ts`
- **Central bank hero images for ECB, PBoC, and BCB** — Added hero images (Wikipedia Commons photos) for the European Central Bank (Frankfurt building), People's Bank of China, and Banco Central do Brasil. Ireland's ECB config also updated. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/countries.ts`

- **Party URLs use sequential IDs** — Party URLs changed from slug-based (`/parties/democrat`) to sequential ID-based (`/parties/1?country=us`). Each country has independent party numbering (US parties: 1, 2, 3..., UK parties: 1, 2, 3...). `slug` field removed from `PoliticalParty` type. New `findPartyBySequentialId()` helper in `src/lib/db/partyLookup.ts`. 83+ files updated across admin routes, API routes, lib utilities, and UI components.
- **Party org momentum simplified** — Removed momentum decay entirely; only drift applies when not actively building. Drift rate halved from -0.25 to -0.125 per turn. Treasury investment now effectively builds org without hidden decay counteracting it. `src/lib/turn/partyOrg/turnProcessing.ts`, `src/lib/turn/partyOrg/constants.ts`.

### Fixed

- **Bond holdings missing from corp tangible book value** — When a corporation buys bonds (sovereign or corporate), the purchased bond asset was not included in the tangible book component of the share-price formula. Only `issuedBondDebt` (bonds issued by the corp) was in the formula; held bond positions were tracked in `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` but never wired in. Added `bondHoldingsAnchor` field to `SharePriceInput` and included it in the `tangibleBook` calculation: `liquidCapital + sectorNPV + bondHoldings − issuedDebt`. Wired from `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` in both `sectorCalculations.ts` and `recomputeSharePrices.ts`. `src/lib/turn/corporation/sharePriceFormula.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/sectorCalculations.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/recomputeSharePrices.ts`
- **Party counter reset on preset switch** — When switching from "No Parties" preset to "Default Parties" preset, party counters are now reset before creating default parties. Previously, default parties would get IDs starting from where the counter left off (e.g., 2 instead of 1). `src/app/api/admin/reset/route.ts`.
- **Create Party button country check** — The "Create Party" button on the National Parties page now only appears when the player's character is in the same country as the page being viewed. US players viewing UK parties no longer see the button. `src/app/parties/page.tsx`, `src/app/parties/components/PartiesHeader.tsx`.
- **Party migration slug index error** — Fixed E11000 duplicate key error during party sequential ID migration by dropping the `slug_1` unique index before updating party documents. Migration bumped to v3. `src/app/api/admin/migrations/party-sequential-ids/route.ts`.
- **Game reset clears party logos** — Custom party logos and hero images are now cleared when resetting default parties to initial state. `src/app/api/admin/reset/route.ts`.

