## [0.0.11] - 2026-02-20

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **Full Bill Lifecycle** - legislation moves through the complete Congressional process:
  - 24-hour voting window per chamber; simple majority (for > against) determines passage.
  - Bills passing both chambers enrolled and sent to the President with a 10-hour action window; no action = pocket signature.
  - Status pipeline: `proposed -> active -> passed_origin -> active_other -> enrolled -> signed / vetoed / failed`.
- **Bill Detail Page** (`/congress/bills/[id]`) - timeline stepper, vote bars, presidential action panel, co-sponsor list, amendment/filibuster/veto-override placeholder cards.
- **Voting API** (`POST /api/congress/bills/[id]`) - `vote`, `cosponsor`, `withdraw`, `presidential_action`; chamber membership enforced.
- **NPP auto-voting** - NPP members automatically vote on bills when voting opens (random: 50 % for / 30 % against / 20 % abstain; per-turn catch-up for latecomers).
- **Admin: Legislation tab** - lists bills with status filters; per-bill force actions: Advance Chamber, Send to President, Force Sign, Force Veto, Fail, Reset.
- **Admin API** (`GET/POST /api/admin/bills`).
- **Turn processor** (`src/lib/billLifecycle.ts`).
- **Full Party Leadership Elections** - Chair, Vice Chair, and Treasurer elections for all state parties:
  - Independent concurrent elections per position; 96-turn (96-hour) cycles.
  - Party members may vote and change their vote any time before close.
  - Tie-breaking by earliest declaration date.
  - Incumbent badge on candidate cards.
- **Election notifications** - members notified on election open, candidacy declaration, win, loss, displacement.
- **Admin: Party Elections panel** - batch-create, process-now, filterable table, cancel per row.
- **Admin: Direct Appointment panel** - on every state party page; dropdowns to appoint / vacate Chair, Vice Chair, Treasurer; cancels conflicting active election.
- **NPP Election Entry Behavior** (`src/lib/nppElectionBehavior.ts`) - NPPs autonomously enter available elections each turn.
- **NPP dropout mechanic** - NPPs withdraw if appeal < 20% of max; per-election cooldown prevents re-entry.
- **Election Continuity System** (`ensurePerpetualElections`) - guarantees every race type runs perpetually.
- **Speaker of the House - Multi-Candidacy Model**: Redesigned to match the real-life House process with self-nomination, multi-candidate races, and simple majority wins.
- **NPP Speaker Behavior** - NPP House members vote for ideologically aligned candidates; may spontaneously nominate players.
- **Admin: Spawn Free-Floating NPPs** - create 1–500 NPPs with state weighting modes (lean, members, both).
- **Home-state candidacy restriction** - players can only enter elections in their home state.
- **Turn system refactored into modules** (`src/lib/turn/`) - `fundGeneration.ts`, `electionResolution.ts`, `primaryResolution.ts`, `perpetualElections.ts`.
- **Admin panel refactored into components** (`src/components/admin/`) - modular tab components for elections, NPPs, users, logs, legislation.
- **Player bio** - editable from `/settings`, displayed on profile as styled pull-quote.
- **Shared `Tooltip` component** - click-to-open on mobile, hover on desktop, auto-flips near edges.
- **USA Map - real geographic state shapes**: SVG map from TopoJSON with Albers USA projection; party-colored fills, hover tooltips, click navigation.
- **Admin: Fix Character Names in Logs** (`POST /api/admin/logs/fix-character-names`) - migration endpoint to populate missing character names in account_created logs.
- **Admin Tab on State Pages** - allows admins to manually assign players/NPPs to vacant Senate and House seats.

### Changed

- **Global Monetary Policy chart currency colors** — Chart now imports `CURRENCY_COLORS` from `currencyDisplay.ts` instead of defining a local subset, so EUR, CNY, BRL, and all other currencies render with the same theme-aware color palette used across the forex page. `src/components/forex/GlobalMonetaryPolicyChart.tsx`, `src/components/forex/currencyDisplay.ts`
- **Central bank hero images for ECB, PBoC, and BCB** — Added hero images (Wikipedia Commons photos) for the European Central Bank (Frankfurt building), People's Bank of China, and Banco Central do Brasil. Ireland's ECB config also updated. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/countries.ts`

- Bills list on Congress page links to detail page; status filter options updated.
- `BillStatus` expanded; `Bill` schema extended with cross-chamber tallies and full timeline timestamps.
- `NotificationType` and `AdminLogAction` extended with bill lifecycle events.
- `StatePartyElection.position` expanded to `"chair" | "viceChair" | "treasurer"`.
- `statePartyElections.ts` rewritten for all three positions; resolution is turn-based.
- **NPP election entry - aggression overhaul**: Empty races 92% entry chance; non-empty 55% at max ambition.
- **`SpeakerResponse` API shape** - `activeCandidacies` array replaces single nomination; adds `houseTotal`, `majority`.
- **Congress Leadership tab** redesigned - all active candidacies shown with vote bars and majority progress.
- **NPP bill voting** overhauled - ideology-weighted instead of random; `seatsHeld` weighting.
- **Actions page fully redesigned** - "Campaign HQ" layout with hero cards, effect pills, category filter.
- **Profile page fully redesigned** - hero card, political standing panel, hourly income breakdown, policy compass.
- **Elections page candidate display** - larger avatars; party/state leadership role guards hardened.
- **Election map toggle gated by filter** - List/Map toggle only appears for House or specific Senate class filters.
- **Political compass** - traditional light colors (green lib-left, yellow lib-right, red auth-left, blue auth-right).
- **Congress page** - replaced dropdown state groups with flat sortable member list; added name/state/seats sorting.
- **Party name capitalization** - "independent" now displays as "Independent" in Congress composition and member lists.

### Fixed

- **Bond holdings missing from corp tangible book value** — When a corporation buys bonds (sovereign or corporate), the purchased bond asset was not included in the tangible book component of the share-price formula. Only `issuedBondDebt` (bonds issued by the corp) was in the formula; held bond positions were tracked in `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` but never wired in. Added `bondHoldingsAnchor` field to `SharePriceInput` and included it in the `tangibleBook` calculation: `liquidCapital + sectorNPV + bondHoldings − issuedDebt`. Wired from `bondAndImfPortfolioAnchorByCorpId` in both `sectorCalculations.ts` and `recomputeSharePrices.ts`. `src/lib/turn/corporation/sharePriceFormula.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/sectorCalculations.ts`, `src/lib/turn/corporation/recomputeSharePrices.ts`
- **Congress page double-count** - vacant `ElectedOfficial` rows filtered; vacancies derived from authoritative seat totals.
- **Speaker seat count** - aggregation summing `seatsHeld` on non-vacant rows; senators excluded from majority calculation.
- **`turnSystem.ts` fallback** - hardcoded 75 actions/turn corrected to 3.
- **NPP bill vote coverage** - explicit `castNPPVotes` call before tallying.
- **State party NPP influence POST** - added missing authorization check.
- **NPP actions visible to non-leaders** - frontend conditionals fixed for vacant leadership positions.
- **Admin Logs character name** - "Account Created" logs now populated with character name when character is created.
- **Ghost seats in election projections** - seat allocation now uses largest-remainder method (Hamilton method) ensuring total seats equals exactly `totalSeats`.

