## [0.0.8] - 2026-02-19

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **NPP Influence Floor** - NPPs start at and cannot decay below 10 % Political Influence.
- **Deterministic NPP Generation** - based on `organizationCap`, not random chance; house elections prioritized.
- **Dynamic Party Buttons in NPP Management** - all parties shown with actual colors.
- **State Senate & Governor Elections** - new race types with full NPP support.

### Changed

- **Global Monetary Policy chart currency colors** — Chart now imports `CURRENCY_COLORS` from `currencyDisplay.ts` instead of defining a local subset, so EUR, CNY, BRL, and all other currencies render with the same theme-aware color palette used across the forex page. `src/components/forex/GlobalMonetaryPolicyChart.tsx`, `src/components/forex/currencyDisplay.ts`
- **Central bank hero images for ECB, PBoC, and BCB** — Added hero images (Wikipedia Commons photos) for the European Central Bank (Frankfurt building), People's Bank of China, and Banco Central do Brasil. Ireland's ECB config also updated. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/countries.ts`

- **Turn Timer** moved from navbar to status bar.
- **Independent Party Color** changed to gray.
- **Third Party Org Cap** - custom parties start at 25 % in all states.

---

## [0.0.7] - 2026-02-16

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **State Adjacency System** - geographic cost modifiers (home 1.0×, neighboring 1.25×, non-neighboring 1.5×).
- **Political Influence Decay** - linear 1 %/turn at 100 %, flat 0.1 %/turn at ≤ 1 %.
- **Global Navbar System** - sticky, consistent across all pages via `NavbarWrapper`.
- **Status Bar** - fixed bottom bar showing Actions and Funds.
- **Attack Failure Mechanic** - infamy % = failure chance; failed attacks still cost actions and gain infamy.

### Changed

- **Global Monetary Policy chart currency colors** — Chart now imports `CURRENCY_COLORS` from `currencyDisplay.ts` instead of defining a local subset, so EUR, CNY, BRL, and all other currencies render with the same theme-aware color palette used across the forex page. `src/components/forex/GlobalMonetaryPolicyChart.tsx`, `src/components/forex/currencyDisplay.ts`
- **Central bank hero images for ECB, PBoC, and BCB** — Added hero images (Wikipedia Commons photos) for the European Central Bank (Frankfurt building), People's Bank of China, and Banco Central do Brasil. Ireland's ECB config also updated. `src/app/api/images/hero/[slug]/route.ts`, `src/lib/constants/countries.ts`

- **Stats Simplification** - dual recognition fields removed; single `politicalInfluence` stat (0–100).
- **Action Economy Rebalance** - starting actions 75 -> 25; base 5 -> 3; costs reduced proportionally.
- **Campaign Action** - simplified to +1 % Political Influence per action, no state selection.

---

## [0.0.6] - 2026-02-15

### Added

- **Auto run for re-election** — New toggle in Settings → Policy Positions lets characters opt in to be automatically entered into upcoming elections in their home district each cycle. A new `autoReelectionEntry` turn phase (runs after `perpetualElections`) queries characters with `autoRunForReelection: true`, matches them to active/upcoming non-presidential elections by `homeState` + `countryId`, and inserts `electionCandidates` entries. Respects the primary entry deadline; skips characters with any prior candidacy entry in the election (preserving manual withdrawals); skips characters blocked by another active candidacy. Presidential races are excluded. `src/lib/db/types/character.ts` (`autoRunForReelection` field), `src/app/api/settings/reelection-preference/route.ts`, `src/lib/turn/autoReelectionEntry.ts`, `src/lib/turnSystem.ts`, `src/app/settings/components/PoliticsSection.tsx`, `src/app/settings/page.tsx`

- **NPP System** - AI politicians with office-holding, election participation, name generation, policy positions, personality traits (loyalty, ambition, stubbornness).
- **NPP Profile Pages** (`/npp/[id]`).
- **NPP Influence System** - Endorse Candidate, Withdraw from Election, Oppose Candidate, Support Leadership; relationship tracking; fund boosting; cooldown/attempt limits.
- **Party-Level NPP Influence** - state and national party chairs/VCs can influence same-party NPPs using party action pool and treasury.
- **Donor Base Level Passive Income** - scales with state population tier.
- **Office Holder Fund Bonuses** - House +$5k/hr, Senate +$15k/hr, Governor +$20k/hr, VP +$25k/hr, President +$50k/hr.

